/download/799268","words":[{"g":"it / him"},null]},{"text":"Él no notó el cambio.","en":"He didn't notice the change.","words":[{"g":"he"},{"g":"no / not"},null,{"g":"the"},{"g":"change, shift"}]},{"text":"Puedo notar que estás cansado(a)","en":"I can tell you're tired.","words":[{"g":"to be able to, can","l":"poder"},null,{"g":"that"},{"g":"to be","l":"estar"},{"g":"tired, weary, wearied"},{"g":"to"}]}]}